encoding  utf-8
survey GreatDouk

###Inputs, add surveys here###
input 1/GreatDouk1.th #Lower main streamway
input 2/GreatDouk2.th #Upper main streamway
input 3/GreatDouk3.th #Inlet halfway up main streamway
input 4/GreatDouk4.th #High level crawl near entrance
input 9/GreatDouk9.th #Crawl to wet sink
input 10/GreatDouk10.th #Crawl to wet sink
input 11/GreatDouk11.th #Shakehole
input 6/GreatDouk6.th #Upper exits
input 7/GreatDouk7.th #Thrutchy exit
input 8/GreatDouk8.th #Wet sink
#input 12/GreatDouk12.th
input 13/GreatDouk13.th #wet sink
input 14/GreatDouk14.th #To southerscales sump
input 15/GreatDouk15.th #wet sink connection
input Pot/Greatdoukpot.th
input GDtoGDP/GDtoGDP.th

###Joins, connecting scraps on the surveys###
join S1@GreatDouk9 S1@GreatDouk10
join S3@GreatDouk1 S1@GreatDouk4
join S1@GreatDouk1 S1@GreatDouk2
join S4@GreatDouk1 S1@GreatDouk3
join S1@GreatDouk11 S2@GreatDouk1
join S4@GreatDouk6 S1@GreatDouk9
join S2@GreatDouk9 S6@GreatDouk6
join S5@GreatDouk6 S1@GreatDouk7
join S3@GreatDouk6 S1@GreatDouk2
join S6@GreatDouk1 S1@GreatDouk14
join S1@GreatDouk15 S1@GreatDouk10
join S1@GreatDouk15 S1@GreatDouk8

###Equates, connecting points on surveys###
equate 9@GreatDouk9 1@GreatDouk10
equate 3@GreatDouk1 26@GreatDouk4
equate 1@GreatDouk2 127@GreatDouk1
equate 108@GreatDouk1 1@GreatDouk3
equate 1@GreatDouk1 1@GreatDouk11
equate 38@GreatDouk6 2@GreatDouk9
equate 1@GreatDouk6 46@GreatDouk2
equate 1@GreatDouk7 56@GreatDouk6
equate 1@GreatDouk1 1@GDtoGDP
#equate 60@GreatDouk12 72@GreatDouk6
equate 36@GreatDouk8 72@GreatDouk6
equate 8@GreatDouk8 1@GreatDouk13
equate 3@GreatDouk1 1@GreatDouk14
equate 3@GDtoGDP 27@Greatdoukpot
equate 47@GreatDouk15 9@GreatDouk10
equate 7@GreatDouk15 8@GreatDouk8


###Map, to create overall map. Input individual survey maps to create the whole###
map plan -projection plan
  plan@GreatDouk1
  plan@GreatDouk11
  plan@GreatDouk2
  plan@GreatDouk4
  plan@GreatDouk3
  plan@GreatDouk6
  plan@GreatDouk7
  plan@GreatDouk10
  plan@GreatDouk9
  #plan@GreatDouk12
  plan@GreatDouk8
  #plan@GreatDouk13
  plan@GreatDouk14
  plan@GreatDouk15
  plan@Greatdoukpot
endmap

#map elev -projection extended
#  
#endmap

endsurvey

